  "title": "Bellinge combined sewer system (Odense, Denmark) — field validation",
  "description": "1.7 km² mainly combined urban drainage system in Bellinge, Odense, with a published EPA SWMM model and years of level-meter records. A candidate runs the published model, unchanged except for its run dates, on eight storms (2011-2019) and is judged against the measured water levels at seven level meters.",
