        "doi": "10.11583/DTU.c.5029124"
      }
    ],
    "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
    "source_dataset_doi": "10.11583/DTU.c.5029124",
    "adaptation_notes": "Uses only CC BY 4.0 items: 7 – Models (SWMM; its rain-gauge file drives the runs) and 2 – Sensor data. Item 3a (rain gauges) is CC BY-NC 4.0 and is not used; the radar (3b) is not needed. The published SWMM model is uncalibrated (ESSD paper §4), so this case judges the model and the engine together. Storms: the eight most intense in the model's rain-gauge series after the level meters start (Aug 2010), including the model's own 29 June 2012 event."
  },
